{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1440842-v5-more-merits-for-more-flaws","id":1440842,"title":"[V5] More Merits for More Flaws","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-03-21T11:46:11-07:00","id":1440842,"title":"[V5] More Merits for More Flaws","content":"I know that is how it worked in previous editions and as far as I know that is not how it works in V5, but I can't seem to find the relevant passages again.<br /> <br /> Could you wonderful folks help me out?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-21T15:14:03-07:00","id":1440862,"title":"","content":"There wouldn't be any passage saying you <i>can't </i>do it, there's just no rule that allows you to. Character creation describes gaining 7 points of Advantages and 2 points of Flaws at the start of the game (and then a modifier for age, if applicable to the game) and doesn't have any text letting you gain extras beyond that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25972-illithidactivity","name":"IllithidActivity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25972_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-21T15:19:21-07:00","id":1440863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IllithidActivity</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1440842-v5-more-merits-for-more-flaws?p=1440862#post1440862\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There wouldn't be any passage saying you <i>can't </i>do it, there's just no rule that allows you to. Character creation describes gaining 7 points of Advantages and 2 points of Flaws at the start of the game (and then a modifier for age, if applicable to the game) and doesn't have any text letting you gain extras beyond that.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what I thought. I also did some more digging after writing this were one of the designers says no extra dots for extra flaws.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-21T18:33:51-07:00","id":1440886,"title":"","content":"For better or worse, V5 works on the concept of omission. If it doesn't say you can do something, generally you can't. Also remember, no dots for the mandatory flaws, either. Just your 7 advantages, and 2 (or more for PT and age) points of required Flaws.<br /> <br /> The only point where you get dots from flaws is in the Coterie Creation section, not during Character Creation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1808,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","user":"elmerg","date":". 03-21-2021, 09:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-21T21:12:42-07:00","id":1440903,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>elmerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1440842-v5-more-merits-for-more-flaws?p=1440886#post1440886\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For better or worse, V5 works on the concept of omission. If it doesn't say you can do something, generally you can't. Also remember, no dots for the mandatory flaws, either. Just your 7 advantages, and 2 (or more for PT and age) points of required Flaws.<br /> <br /> The only point where you get dots from flaws is in the Coterie Creation section, not during Character Creation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}